Run: `go test ./cmd/entire/cli/settings/ -run TestLoadFromBytes_CustomSecrets -v`
Expected: PASS.

- [ ] **Step 5: Run full settings package tests to confirm no regressions**

Run: `go test ./cmd/entire/cli/settings/ -v`
Expected: all tests pass.

